   "source": [
    "# Stage 3 — Colon Cancer Classifier (EfficientNet-B0)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Project:** Colorectal Cancer CAD Pipeline  \n",
    "**Task:** Binary classification — `colon_aca` (cancer) vs `colon_n` (normal)  \n",
    "**Dataset:** LC25000 colon subset (10,000 images, 5000 per class)  \n",
    "**Model:** EfficientNet-B0 (pretrained on ImageNet, fine-tuned)  \n",
    "\n",
    "### Pipeline\n",
    "```\n",
    "HuggingFace Dataset\n",
    "      ↓\n",
    "Train/Val/Test Split (70/15/15)\n",
    "      ↓\n",
    "EfficientNet-B0 Fine-tuning\n",
    "      ↓\n",
    "Evaluation (Accuracy, F1, Confusion Matrix)\n",
    "      ↓\n",
    "Save Weights → Google Drive\n",
    "```"
   ]
